---
import { pricing } from '../data/pricing';
const money = (n: number) => '$' + n.toLocaleString('en-US');
const cards = [
 {image:'fees-planning',alt:'纸张上的计算器',caption:'初诊、基础检查和后续治疗分开核对',title:'生育评估',tag:'01 / UNDERSTAND',price:'$250',unit:'首次医生咨询预算',text:'整理已有报告，看要补哪些检查、下一步怎么走。',items:['病史和以前的治疗记录','基础检查预算 $800–1,500','查什么由医生定']},
 {image:'fees-laboratory',alt:'实验室移液操作近景',caption:'取卵培养基础费与附加实验室项目分开计算',title:'IVF治疗计划',tag:'02 / IVF JOURNEY',price:'$15,000',unit:'取卵与培养基础预算',text:'从一次取卵周期开始，按评估结果安排实验室项目和移植。',items:['常规监测、一次取卵与培养','药物、麻醉及移植等另计','可在下面组合费用项目']},
 {image:'fees-preservation',alt:'实验室移液器',caption:'取卵冷冻、年度保存及未来使用分别计费',title:'冻卵与生育力保存',tag:'03 / PRESERVE',price:'$9,000',unit:'冻卵周期基础预算',text:'取卵冷冻、保存和以后再用，费用分开看。',items:['常规监测、一次取卵及冷冻','药物、麻醉及保存另计','以后解冻、受精和移植另算']}
];
---
<section class="pricing-section" id="cost" aria-labelledby="pricing-title"><div class="pricing-wrap">
<h2 id="pricing-title">IVF治疗费用预算</h2>
<p class="intro">先看结论：<strong>做一次较完整的试管婴儿（含药物、麻醉、ICSI、冷冻和一次冻胚移植），预算大约 $26,100–31,100。</strong>每项包含什么、怎么组合，下面都能查。参考预算以院方书面报价为准。</p>

<p class="intro"><strong>为什么有两个 IVF 金额？</strong> $15,000 只是取卵和胚胎培养的基础价；$26,100–31,100 是计算器默认示例，另加了药物、麻醉、ICSI、冷冻和一次冻胚移植。示例也没含全部支出，实际以个人方案的书面报价为准。</p><section class="cost-explainer" aria-labelledby="cost-explainer-title"><h3 id="cost-explainer-title">组合预算是怎样算出的？</h3><p>以下对应计算器默认勾选的项目；ICSI等附加操作是否需要，由医生评估。</p><div class="cost-equation" aria-label="默认组合预算的费用构成">{['ivf','medication','anesthesia','icsi','freeze','fet'].map(id=>{const row=pricing.find(item=>item.id===id)!;return <div class="cost-piece"><span>{row.label}</span><strong>{money(row.min)}{row.max!==row.min?'–'+money(row.max):''}</strong></div>})}<div class="cost-piece cost-sum"><span>默认组合合计</span><strong>$26,100–31,100</strong></div></div><p class="equation-note">初诊检查、移植药物、年度保存和交通住宿未计入此合计。</p><a class="inline-link" href="#budget-planner">调整项目，查看你的组合预算</a></section><div class="price-cards">{cards.map(card => <article><figure class="price-illustration"><img src={`/images/stock/${card.image}.webp`} alt={card.alt} width="1000" height="650" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>{card.caption}</figcaption></figure><h3>{card.title}</h3><div class="price">{card.price}<small>{card.unit}</small></div><p>{card.text}</p><ul>{card.items.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul><a href="/contact/">咨询项目费用</a></article>)}</div>
<div class="estimator" id="budget-planner"><div><h3>估算治疗费用</h3><p>选想了解的治疗和费用项目，查看参考合计。默认勾选只是示例，不代表医生建议。</p><p>冻胚移植（FET）：把冻好的胚胎解冻再移植；PGT-A：查胚胎染色体数目，做不做听医生的。</p><label class="path-label">治疗路径<select id="budget-path"><option value="ivf">IVF取卵与培养</option><option value="egg">冻卵周期</option><option value="fet">仅冻胚移植</option></select></label><div class="budget-options">{pricing.filter(row=>['medication','anesthesia','icsi','freeze','fet','pgt','storage'].includes(row.id)).map(row=><label data-option={row.id}><input type="checkbox" value={row.id} checked={['medication','anesthesia','icsi','freeze','fet'].includes(row.id)}/><span>{row.label}</span></label>)}</div></div><div class="budget-result"><output id="budget-total" aria-live="polite">$26,100–31,100</output><p id="budget-description">一次取卵培养、促排药物、麻醉、ICSI、冷冻及一次冻胚移植。</p><p><strong>未包含：</strong>初诊检查、移植药物、交通住宿、额外周期、并发症处理，以及没勾选的项目。</p><p>ICSI 和 PGT 不是每个人都要做；治疗也不保证形成可移植胚胎或怀孕。</p><button id="budget-copy" type="button">复制费用明细</button><span id="budget-status" role="status"></span></div></div>
<details class="itemized"><summary>查看11项费用明细与包含范围</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>方案预算假设 · 单位USD；除保存费按年外，按一次服务或周期计</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">项目</th><th scope="col">预算</th><th scope="col">范围与另计事项</th></tr></thead><tbody>{pricing.map(row=><tr><th scope="row">{row.label}</th><td>{money(row.min)}{row.max!==row.min ? '–'+money(row.max):''}</td><td>{row.note}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></details>
<div class="cost-notes"><article><h3>这里的合计包含什么？</h3><p>合计只算所选治疗的基础金额和勾选项目，初诊检查、移植药物、交通住宿和额外治疗都没算。</p></article><article><h3>取消或追加治疗</h3><p>本页没有院方确认的退费标准。周期取消、没形成胚胎或追加治疗的费用，付款前要拿到书面说明。</p></article><article><h3>第三方生育费用</h3><p>捐卵、捐精和第三方妊娠的费用不包含在示例内，要确认供应方、医疗条件和合同。</p></article></div>
<p class="source">费用量级参考 <a href="https://www.illumefertility.com/pricing-and-insurance/ivf-costs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">美国机构公开费用指南</a>；本页固定金额为编制假设，并非该机构或 SIVF 的报价。请勿把美国参考价格当成塞班当地均价。</p>
</div></section>
<script>
import { pricing } from '../data/pricing';
const path=document.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('#budget-path')!;
const inputs=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('.budget-options input'));
const total=document.querySelector<HTMLOutputElement>('#budget-total')!;
const description=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#budget-description')!;
const status=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#budget-status')!;
function update(){
 const allowed=path.value==='ivf'?['medication','anesthesia','icsi','freeze','fet','pgt','storage']:path.value==='egg'?['medication','anesthesia','storage']:['storage'];
 inputs.forEach(input=>{input.disabled=!allowed.includes(input.value);input.closest<HTMLElement>('label')!.hidden=input.disabled;});
 const selected=pricing.filter(row=>row.id===path.value||inputs.some(input=>!input.disabled&&input.checked&&input.value===row.id));
 const min=selected.reduce((sum,row)=>sum+row.min,0),max=selected.reduce((sum,row)=>sum+row.max,0);
 total.textContent='$'+min.toLocaleString('en-US')+(max!==min?'–'+max.toLocaleString('en-US'):'');
 description.textContent=selected.map(row=>row.label).join(' + ');status.textContent='';
}
path.addEventListener('change',update);inputs.forEach(input=>input.addEventListener('change',update));update();
document.querySelector('#budget-copy')!.addEventListener('click',async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText('非医院正式报价｜方案预算示例（USD）\n'+description.textContent+'\n'+total.textContent+'\n未含初诊检查、移植药物、交通住宿、额外治疗及未选择项目；请取得医院书面报价。');status.textContent='已复制';}catch{status.textContent='复制未成功，请选中预算文字手动复制。';}});
</script>
<style>
.pricing-section{padding:var(--space) 0;background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink)}.pricing-wrap{max-width:1536px;margin:auto;padding-inline:var(--gutter)}h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,44px);line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 28px}p,li{color:var(--ink);font-size:16px;line-height:1.85}.intro{max-width:58em;margin-bottom:25px}.draft{background:var(--light);padding:24px 30px;margin:32px 0}.draft p{margin:10px 0 0;font-size:15px}.price-cards{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:35px;margin:50px 0}.price-cards article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:50px;padding:30px;background:white}.price-cards h3{grid-column:1;font-size:28px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 20px}.price{grid-column:1;grid-row:2;font-size:42px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.3}.price small{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;letter-spacing:0}.price-cards article>p{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;margin:0 0 15px}.price-cards ul{grid-column:2;margin:0 0 22px;padding-left:20px}.price-cards article>a{grid-column:2}.price-cards a,.source a{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;font-size:15px}.estimator{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;margin:60px 0;background:var(--light);padding:40px}.estimator h3{font-size:30px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 20px}.path-label{display:grid;gap:12px;font-size:16px}select{padding:15px;background:white;border:1px solid #b6cdd2;width:100%;color:var(--ink);font:inherit}.budget-options{display:grid;gap:17px;margin-top:26px}.budget-options label{display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:16px;align-items:center}.budget-options label[hidden]{display:none}.budget-options input{accent-color:var(--blue);width:20px;height:20px}.budget-result{background:white;padding:30px;align-self:start;min-width:0}output{display:block;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,44px);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:20px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}button{background:var(--deep);color:white;padding:16px 20px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:15px;min-height:48px}#budget-status{display:block;font-size:14px;margin-top:12px}.itemized{background:white;padding:26px}.itemized summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:20px}.table-scroll{overflow-x:auto}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:580px;margin-top:20px}caption{text-align:left;font-size:14px;padding:15px 0}td,th{font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;padding:18px 12px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #c9dbe0}td:nth-child(2){white-space:nowrap}.cost-notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;margin:50px 0}.cost-notes h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:500}.source{font-size:14px;max-width:65em}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:800px){.estimator,.cost-notes{grid-template-columns:1fr}.estimator{padding:25px;gap:25px}.price-cards article{column-gap:25px}.price-cards h3{font-size:24px}}@media(max-width:520px){.price-cards article{display:block;padding:25px}.price-cards article>p{margin:20px 0}.price-cards h3{font-size:27px}.price{font-size:40px}.estimator{padding:20px}.budget-result{padding:22px}.itemized{padding:20px}}

.cost-explainer{background:var(--light);padding:30px;margin:35px 0 45px}.cost-explainer h3{font-size:27px;margin:0 0 18px}.cost-explainer>p{margin:0 0 25px}.cost-equation{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.cost-piece{background:white;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;min-width:0}.cost-piece span{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}.cost-piece strong{font-size:24px;font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.4;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.cost-piece.cost-sum{grid-column:1/-1;background:var(--deep);color:white;flex-direction:row;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.cost-explainer p.equation-note{font-size:14px;margin:20px 0 0}.price-cards article{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,38%) minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:35px;align-items:start}.price-illustration{grid-column:1;grid-row:1/6;align-self:stretch;margin:0;min-height:310px;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.price-illustration img{position:absolute;inset:0 0 52px;width:100%;height:calc(100% - 52px);object-fit:cover}.price-illustration figcaption{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;min-height:40px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}.price-cards h3,.price-cards .price,.price-cards article>p,.price-cards article>ul,.price-cards article>a{grid-column:2;grid-row:auto}.price-cards .price{margin-bottom:20px}.price-cards article>p{margin-top:0}.price-cards article>a{justify-self:start}@media(max-width:800px){.cost-equation{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.price-cards article{column-gap:25px}.cost-piece strong{font-size:22px}}@media(max-width:520px){.cost-explainer{padding:23px}.cost-explainer h3{font-size:24px}.cost-equation{gap:10px}.cost-piece{padding:15px}.cost-piece span{font-size:14px}.cost-piece strong{font-size:20px}.cost-piece.cost-sum{display:block}.cost-sum strong{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:28px}.price-cards article{display:block}.price-illustration{height:245px;min-height:0;margin-bottom:25px}.price-illustration img{height:190px;bottom:auto}.price-illustration figcaption{bottom:0}.price-cards h3{margin-top:0}}
</style>